# MUI v7

- Always wrap the app with `ThemeProvider` **and** `CssBaseline`.
- Use theme tokens (`primary.main`, `text.secondary`, `grey.100`). Avoid raw `#000` / `#fff` except in `theme.js`.
- MUI Grid v7 uses `size`, not the old `item xs sm md` API:

```jsx
// ❌ BAD
<Grid item xs={12} md={6}>

// ✅ GOOD
<Grid size={{ xs: 12, md: 6 }}>
```

- Heading semantics: visual style via `variant`, real tag via `component`. One `h1` in the hero. Sections use `h2`.

```jsx
<Typography component="h2" variant="h4">Experience</Typography>
```

- Landmarks: `header`/`nav` in the app bar, `main` for page content, `section` per block, `footer` for the footer.
- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label`. External links use `target="_blank"` and `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.
